IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STDIN.
*> Torture test: reads stdin with test-input.txt
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINE PIC X(80).
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-LINE = SPACES
        ACCEPT WS-LINE
        IF WS-LINE NOT = SPACES
            ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
            DISPLAY "Line " WS-COUNT ": " WS-LINE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.
    DISPLAY "Total lines read: " WS-COUNT.
    STOP RUN.